Potato dextrose agar (PDA), malt extract agar (MEA) and malt extract (ME) were purchased from Sigma-Aldrich (USA). The Ganoderma resinaceum culture used in this experiment was obtained from a wild basidiocarp found at the shores of Lago di Varese, Lombardy (Italy) in 2018 and maintained in alternate PDA and MEA slants at MOGU S.r.l. for the last 3 years at 4 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
